msgid "Upgrade Views"
msgstr "뷰 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:9
msgid "Documentations"
msgstr "문서"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:11
msgid ""
"`View Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/general/views.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`뷰 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/general/views.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`View Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </outgoing/views>`"
msgstr ":doc:`뷰 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </outgoing/views>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:15
msgid "What has been changed"
msgstr "변경된 사항"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:17
msgid ""
"Your views look much like before, but they are invoked differently ... "
"instead of CI3's ``$this->load->view('x');``, you can use ``return "
"view('x');``."
msgstr ""
"뷰는 이전과 매우 유사하지만 호출 방식이 다릅니다. CI3의 ``$this->load->view('x');`` 대신 "
"``return view('x');``\ 를 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:19
msgid ""
"CI4 supports :doc:`../outgoing/view_cells` to build your response in "
"pieces, and :doc:`../outgoing/view_layouts` for page layout."
msgstr ""
"CI4는 응답을 조각으로 구성하기 위한 :doc:`../outgoing/view_cells`\ 와 "
"페이지 레이아웃을 위한 :doc:`../outgoing/view_layouts`\ 를 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:21
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Template Parser <../outgoing/view_parser>` is still there, and "
"substantially enhanced."
msgstr ""
":doc:`템플릿 파서 <../outgoing/view_parser>`\ 는 여전히 존재하며 크게 향상되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:24
msgid "Upgrade Guide"
msgstr "업그레이드 가이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:26
msgid "First, move all views  to the folder **app/Views**"
msgstr "먼저 모든 뷰를 **app/Views** 폴더로 이동하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:27
msgid "Change the loading syntax of views in every script where you load views:"
msgstr "뷰를 로드하는 모든 스크립트에서 뷰 로드 구문을 변경하십시오:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:28
msgid ""
"from ``$this->load->view('directory_name/file_name')`` to ``return "
"view('directory_name/file_name');``"
msgstr ""
"``$this->load->view('directory_name/file_name')``\ 에서 "
"``return view('directory_name/file_name');``\ 으로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:29
msgid ""
"from ``$content = $this->load->view('file', $data, TRUE);`` to ``$content"
" = view('file', $data);``"
msgstr ""
"``$content = $this->load->view('file', $data, TRUE);``\ 에서 "
"``$content = view('file', $data);``\ 으로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:30
msgid ""
"(optional) You can change the echo syntax in views from ``<?php echo "
"$title; ?>`` to ``<?= $title ?>``"
msgstr ""
"(선택 사항) 뷰의 echo 구문을 ``<?php echo $title; ?>``\ 에서 ``<?= $title ?>``\ 으로 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:31
msgid ""
"Remove the line ``defined('BASEPATH') OR exit('No direct script access "
"allowed');`` if it exists."
msgstr ""
"``defined('BASEPATH') OR exit('No direct script access allowed');`` 줄이 있으면 제거하십시오."

